{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "UndefinedVariableInReactionSystemContinuousEventCondition",
    "description": "Invalid: an undefined name inside a REACTION SYSTEM continuous event's zero-crossing `conditions` expression. An event is the same site on a reaction system as on a model, so it carries the same code as undefined_variable_in_continuous_event_condition.esm. `A`, `B` and `k` are declared; the ONLY defect is the undefined name `undefined_xyz`. Expected error: undefined_variable @ /reaction_systems/TestReactions/continuous_events/0/conditions/0.",
